renderings.text:
Guide me in your truth;
teach me.
You are the God who saves me;
I wait for you all day.

LORD, remember your mercy,
your faithful love;
they've been yours through the ages.

The LORD is good and upright;
so he teaches sinners
the way to go.

LORD, for the sake of your name,
forgive my guilt;
there's so much to forgive.

The LORD confides in those
who fear him;
he makes his covenant known.

My eyes stay on the LORD;
he'll bring my feet
out of the net.

Guard my soul and rescue me;
don't let me be shamed.
I've taken shelter in you.

Let integrity and uprightness
guard me;
I wait for you.
